==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Dunsparce|137}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*'''Sudden Flash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Dunsparce|60}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

